"""
Introduction
************

HRAN testline configuration library which converts hran testline yaml configuration files to ute python
configuration files

Env config file
***************

General rules
--------------
Configuration file env_config_<id>.yaml should be created inside testline configuration directory:

::

    hran_ta/config/<hw_location_code>/<testlineType_testlineId_testlineName>/env_config_<id>.yaml
    e.g. hran_ta/config/Wroclaw/SBTS_14252_Surykatka/env_config_1.yaml

Access to testline configuration is via variable provided for **robot** during the execution:

::
    robot --variablefile hran_ta/config/Wroclaw/SBTS_14252_Surykatka/env_config_1.yaml

HRAN Template
-------------

HRAN Template should be used to create testline configuration files.
Followed HRAN testline configuration files should be created:

::


    hran_ta/config/Template/<testlineType_testlineId_testlineName>/env_config_<id>.yaml
    hran_ta/config/Template/<testlineType_testlineId_testlineName>/device/interfaces.yaml
    hran_ta/config/Template/<testlineType_testlineId_testlineName>/device/ues.yaml

according to template which can be found in

::
    hran_ta/config/Template/<testlineType_testlineId_testlineName>


HRAN configuration file to UTE configuration file conversion
-------------------------------------------------------------
To convert hran testline yaml configuration files followed parameters are mandatory:

    env_config_<id>.yaml:

        | Parameter Name | Description                               | Comment        |
        | PC_IP1         | PC/VM connected to SMOD1                  |                |
        | PC_IP2         | PC/VM connected to SMOD2                  | only if exists |
        | INTERFACES     | Defined in interfaces.yaml                |                |
        | SMOD1          | MSM ID as in config/common/fsm_rel.yaml   |                |
        | SMOD2          | ESM ID as in config/common/fsm_rel.yaml   | only if exists |
        | TA_UE_CONFIG   | defined UEs pool for calls                |                |
"""
from .interface import hran_testline_configuration  # noqa: F401
